<<else>>
	滚烫的铜灯罩烫红了你的指尖，海风灌进领口让人直打哆嗦。<span class="red">灯罩烫伤手指，海风吹得你发冷。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "用铁丝扎紧防风灯底座挂钩 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-docks-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<span class="green">引水信号灯恢复了明亮光束。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_docks_4")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">灯罩烫伤手指，海风吹得你发冷。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment School 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
理科实验室外的走廊里，一只刚洗好的玻璃冷凝管从晾干架滑落，眼看就要砸在大理石地面上。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校走廊 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="moment-school-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "一个箭步上前双手稳稳接住 (0:04)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-school-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	冷凝管完好无损地落在你手中，值日助教松了口气，把实验室多余的护手霜送给了你。<span class="green">你毫发无损地救下了实验器皿。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_school_1")>><<money 220>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺走廊去学校图书馆 (0:03)|MP Moment School 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你接管子时手肘撞在走廊储物柜门上，震得手臂一阵酸麻。<span class="red">手肘磕上铁柜，疼得直吸凉气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺走廊去学校图书馆 (0:03)|MP Moment School 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "用书包垫在地面缓冲接取 (0:04)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-school-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<span class="green">你毫发无损地救下了实验器皿。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_school_1")>><<money 220>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺走廊去学校图书馆 (0:03)|MP Moment School 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">手肘磕上铁柜，疼得直吸凉气。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺走廊去学校图书馆 (0:03)|MP Moment School 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment School 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
学校图书馆古籍区的滑动木梯卡在了高处导轨槽里，一名低年级学生正踮着脚够不着顶层的历史辞典。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校走廊 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="moment-school-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "拨正导轨铜滑轮推顺木梯 (0:05)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-school-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	厚辞典顺利取下，书页间还夹着一张前人留下的购书礼券，学生连声道谢。<span class="green">你帮低年级学生取下了古籍辞典。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_school_2")>><<money 240>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去泳池更衣廊查看 (0:03)|MP Moment School 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	顶层积灰扑面落下，沉重的辞典压得你手腕一酸差点脱手。<span class="red">灰尘迷眼且手腕被重书压酸。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去泳池更衣廊查看 (0:03)|MP Moment School 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "踩上木梯替学生取下厚辞典 (0:05)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-school-2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<span class="green">你帮低年级学生取下了古籍辞典。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_school_2")>><<money 240>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去泳池更衣廊查看 (0:03)|MP Moment School 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">灰尘迷眼且手腕被重书压酸。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去泳池更衣廊查看 (0:03)|MP Moment School 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment School 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
学校泳池更衣室尽头的蒸汽暖水阀没关严，滚烫白雾把整面衣柜镜都糊满了，地面瓷砖湿滑无比。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校走廊 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="moment-school-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "裹上干毛巾拧紧黄铜暖水阀 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-school-3">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	水雾很快散尽，你在阀门底座下捡到了谁遗落的储物柜零钱盒。<span class="green">更衣室恢复了干爽通透。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_school_3")>><<money 240>><</if>>
