<<else>>
	湿滑瓷砖让你脚底一滑摔了个屁股墩，热水还溅湿了衣角。<span class="red">你在湿瓷砖上滑了一跤。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去放学后的音乐教室 (0:03)|MP Moment School 4]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "推开高处气窗排散满屋白雾 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-school-3">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
