<<else>>
	摆针猛地弹回敲在你的指甲盖上，震得指尖发麻。<span class="red">回弹的摆针敲痛了你的指尖。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校走廊 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "帮值日生盖好琴盖整理谱架 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-school-4">>
