	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_school_4")>><<money 220>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校走廊 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">回弹的摆针敲痛了你的指尖。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校走廊 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Park 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
公园郁金香花圃外侧的低矮铸铁护栏被昨夜雨水冲松了根基，几株盛开的花茎正被倾斜的铁栏压弯。
<br><br>
